# Build artefacts
build/
dist/

# Derived SQLite analysis index — rebuildable from the JSONL captures, never the
# source of truth (see findings/sqlite-analysis-layer.md). Keep it out of findings/.
*.sqlite
# ...except the main analysis index: committed (owner's call, 2026-06-22) so it syncs across
# machines without a rebuild. JSONL captures remain the source of truth; the DB is still fully
# regenerable via 13/14_build_*. NB it's a ~44 MB binary, so it bloats history on each rebuild
# (consider git-lfs / a periodic history squash if that becomes a problem).
!captures.sqlite
*.sqlite-journal
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Local config — actual deployment values
config.local.toml

# Don't ignore findings — those are committed
!findings/
